# Generated customer documents (order forms are produced client-side and
# downloaded straight to the user's machine — none belong in the repo).
# Fonts / images that the generators embed live under public/ and are kept.
# Root-anchored so they don't accidentally match source dirs (e.g. src/lib/exports/).
/exports/
/generated/
/poc-exports/
*.pdf
*.docx

# Experimental HTML→PDF POC scratch bundle
.poc-bundle-*.mjs
